. Krueger, B.J. Oswald, and M.A. McNiven. <year>1998</year>. Dynamin-mediated internalization of caveolae. <source>J. Cell Biol.</source> <volume>141</volume>:<fpage>85</fpage>&#x02013;99.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9531550</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal">Hill, E., J. van Der Kaay, C.P. Downes, and E. Smythe. <year>2001</year>. The role of dynamin and its binding partners in coated pit invagination and scission. <source>J. Cell Biol.</source> <volume>152</volume>:<fpage>309</fpage>&#x02013;323.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11266448</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><citation citation-type="journal">Hinshaw, J.E. <year>2000</year>. Dynamin and its role in membrane fission. <source>Annu. Rev. Cell Dev. Biol.</source> <volume>16</volume>:<fpage>483</fpage>&#x02013;519.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11031245</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib16"><citation citation-type="journal">Hussain, N.K., S. Jenna, M. Glogauer, C.C. Quinn, S. Wasiak, M. Guipponi, S.E. Antonarakis, B.K. Kay, T.P. Stossel, N. Lamarche-Vane, and P.S. McPherson. <year>2001</year>. Endocytic protein intersectin-l regulates actin assembly via Cdc42 and N-WASP. <source>Nat. Cell Biol.</source> <volume>3</volume>:<fpage>927</fpage>&#x02013;932.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11584276</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib17"><citation citation-type="journal">Jost, M., F. Simpson, J.M. Kavran, M.A. Lemmon, and S.L. Schmid. <year>1998</year>. Phosphatidylinositol-4,5-bisphosphate is required for endocytic coated vesicle formation. <source>Curr. Biol.</source> <volume>8</volume>:<fpage>1399</fpage>&#x02013;1402.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9889104</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib18"><citation citation-type="journal">Kessels, M.M., and B. Qualmann. <year>2002</year>. Syndapins integrate N-WASP in receptor-mediated endocytosis. <source>EMBO J.</source> <volume>21</volume>:<fpage>6083</fpage>&#x02013;6094.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12426380</pub-id></citation></ref><ref 